# Ignore rules for the Atlas Community image build. Paths are relative to the build context
# (the monorepo root — see Dockerfile). BuildKit reads this file because it is named
# "<dockerfile>.dockerignore" next to the Dockerfile.

# Build artefacts — never ship these into the build context.
**/bin
**/obj

# Local SQLite databases and their WAL/SHM sidecars.
**/atlas.db
**/atlas.db-shm
**/atlas.db-wal

# VCS, IDE and OS noise.
**/.git
**/.github
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/*.user
**/.DS_Store

# The Dockerfile copies only what it needs from atlas-community and .local-nuget; keep the
# rest of the monorepo out of the context so builds stay fast and reproducible.
